# Ink Library Rules

- Additive APIs only — no breaking prop removals in a patch.
- CSS class prefix: `Ink-` (BEM).
- Peer deps: React only for core; Angular optional peer.
- Premium features gated via `resolveInkPremium` / `hasInkPremiumFeature`.
- Do not name competitor products in user-facing strings or README marketing lines.
- Branching: `{feature|bug}/{PROJECT}-{n}` (e.g. `feature/INK-26`) → integration (`feature/1.1.7-cms-real` or `release/{sprint}`) → `main`. See `git-jira-branching.mdc`.
